@EXIST_ADD_GAME_INFO1
#LOCALSIZE 1
#LOCALSSIZE 1

@ADD_GAME_INFO1(ARG, O_DATA, V_NAME)
#FUNCTION
#LOCALSIZE 1
#LOCALSSIZE 1
#DIMS O_DATA
#DIMS V_NAME
SELECTCASE O_DATA
	CASE "NAME"
		CALLF MAKE_STR(V_NAME, "Cards")
	CASE "DESCRIPTION"
		CALLF MAKE_STR(V_NAME, "카드 게임")
	CASE "MINPLAYERS"
		CALLF MAKE_INT(V_NAME, 2)
	CASE "MAXPLAYERS"
		CALLF MAKE_INT(V_NAME, 4)
	CASE "CHECKREQUIREMENTS"
		SIF INROOM(CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置)
			CALLF MAKE_INT(V_NAME, 1)
	CASE "VALIDBETS"
		CALLF MAKE_STR(V_NAME, ADD_GAME_STANDARD_BETS())
	CASE "DURATION"
		CALLF MAKE_INT(V_NAME, 30)
ENDSELECT

@ADD_GAME1
PRINTFORML 당신 중 %NUM_COUNT(ADD_GAME_PARTICIPANT_COUNT)% 명이 신나는 카드 게임을 한다.
CALL ADD_GAME_DEFAULT_CALCULATION
PRINTFORML 치열한 경기가 끝난 후, %ADD_GAME_LIST_NAMES(ADD_GAME_WINNERS)%가 승자로 선언된다.

